snapshots, and NAT/connectivity were shown to be recovered and actively serving traffic after all restarts.","limitations":["The full VyOS 'show configuration commands' output was never successfully captured (multiple attempts failed with 'command not found' due to shell context issues), so the complete persisted config file content was not directly observed; however, the targeted 'show nat source' / 'show firewall ipv4 forward filter' / 'show interfaces ethernet eth1' outputs and the config.boot inspection substitute adequately for verifying the relevant sections.","No test was performed for traffic sourced from node2/node3 outside ICMP/HTTP(curl), so coverage of 'processes' reaching the internet is representative rather than exhaustive."]},"ttft_ms":16079,"type":"result","duration_ms":77253,"uuid":"b6ea91bb-38f9-43a3-b373-191ab26bc457","ttft_stream_ms":1042,"time_to_request_ms":42,"queued_turn_count":0}
